# Optional reference only — do not paste this by hand.
#
# Use this when the database already has cover URLs on a files.* host
# (e.g. https://files.pay-tracker.site/paytracker/events/...). After MinIO
# is gone, the app serves those objects at /files/... on the app container.
#
#   sudo ./scripts/setup-nginx.sh files
#
# Fresh installs with S3_PUBLIC_URL=https://your.domain/files do not need
# a files subdomain.
